      "text": "Delhi: DCP Nishant Gupta on traffic advisory for the South Africa vs Zimbabwe match at Arun Jaitley Stadium, says, \"...We are advising people that during the start of the match, around 12 to 3 PM, and when the match ends around 8 PM, for about 2 hours, there may be some traffic impact on Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg and ITO. Because a large number of people come and disperse, traffic becomes slightly heavy...\"",
